-rblx-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2023 Q4","e":"rblx","d":"2024-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"So we believe naturally, irrespective of the layoffs, our creator community will continue to grow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/07/roblox-rblx-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2023 Q4","e":"rblx","d":"2024-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Omar Dessouky","x":"I wanted to get a sense of how much the developer layoffs in the video game industry could potentially be a tailwind for you in 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/07/roblox-rblx-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q1","e":"rblx","d":"2024-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"So we are going to be looking at lowering our guidance in 2024 a bit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/09/roblox-rblx-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q1","e":"rblx","d":"2024-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Omar Dessouky","x":"So then it's -- we should kind of think about calendar '24, the lower guidance is a one-off due to the factors that you mentioned, such as lapping PlayStation and the Easter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/09/roblox-rblx-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q2","e":"rblx","d":"2024-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mike Guthrie","x":"This is probably one of the best examples of using artificial intelligence and all of the compute and logic power behind that to make something in our cost structure better and more efficient and safer, but also driving the cost down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/01/roblox-rblx-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q2","e":"rblx","d":"2024-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Guthrie","x":"…months ago when we did the call, we have started to see the level of improvement happening in the back half of April and the beginning of March, and we were cautiously optimistic and reflected in our guidance -- lower guidance at the time that we didn't have enough data to project that forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/01/roblox-rblx-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q3","e":"rblx","d":"2024-10-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"I believe we're below $0.01 per hour right now, including cloud simulation, cloud analytics, cloud 3D streaming on 3D immersive gaming, our safety infrastructure, our AI safety infrastructure, and thousands of moderators.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/31/roblox-rblx-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q3","e":"rblx","d":"2024-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"I want to highlight that this increase versus Q2 is driven by investments in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/31/roblox-rblx-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q3","e":"rblx","d":"2024-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"And this includes migrating more and more of our safety infrastructure to AI where possible and where responsible to do so.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/31/roblox-rblx-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q4","e":"rblx","d":"2025-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"MrBeast in conjunction with Beast Games going live on TV and on streaming brought MrBeast experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/roblox-rblx-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q4","e":"rblx","d":"2025-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"And that's a vision of 3D streaming, supporting instant connection with 3D content.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/roblox-rblx-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2024 Q4","e":"rblx","d":"2025-02-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dave Baszucki","x":"This is as we improve the way we drive quality and efficiency with AI and the way we run lean infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/roblox-rblx-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2025 Q4","e":"rblx","d":"2026-02-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Baszucki","x":"We have now are in the middle of a full cloud rollout of native streaming of both 2D and 3D with various LODs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/roblox-rblx-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2025 Q4","e":"rblx","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Tiffany","x":"And I want to put a finer point on the concerns that we've seen coming up in the market over the past week about the potential for, you know, disruption to your business from other, you know, advances from with AI coming from other companies out there in the space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/roblox-rblx-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2026 Q1","e":"rblx","d":"2026-04-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Baszucki","x":"Together with deep tech like instance streaming, mesh streaming, texture streaming, server authority, and SLIM, these updates remove barriers our creators have seen in creating more original experiences for older users.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/roblox-rblx-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2026 Q1","e":"rblx","d":"2026-04-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Baszucki","x":"One of the most attractive things to studios—whether traditionally mobile or PC game creators—is the unique architecture of Roblox Corporation: the same build, the same game, whether it is PC, tablet, console, or phone, dynamically scaling with tech like SLIM, texture streaming, and mesh streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/roblox-rblx-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2026 Q1","e":"rblx","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Naveen K. Chopra","x":"As a result, we are lowering our guidance for full-year top-line growth to account for a continuation of these safety headwinds that we have experienced to date.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/roblox-rblx-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2026 Q1","e":"rblx","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"David Baszucki","x":"These technologies are being used to support creators on everything ranging from light assistance to fully vibe-coded content.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/roblox-rblx-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2026 Q3","e":"rblx","d":"2026-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Baszucki","x":"Games on Roblox join instantly with 3D streaming rather than with a download.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/roblox-rblx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2026 Q3","e":"rblx","d":"2026-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Baszucki","x":"Our dynamic LOD mesh system our texture streaming system, and server authority with client prediction for fair low latency play.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/roblox-rblx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBLX 2026 Q3","e":"rblx","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Naveen K. Chopra","x":"And on our margin guidance, we expect increased infrastructure expense relative to Q3 for AI initiatives, including things like build, Roblox Reality, and Universal Player.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/roblox-rblx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[45,1,7662,0,0,0,614